time Note card [note: pop]

scale slot 12s 6
row block
zoom 0-2

box proposer [note: One is picked for each slot and builds the block of that slot, example: The one picked in slot 0]
box block

step Build
  say A box with note gets an i mark at its top right in every column. Click it and a card with the whole note and an example band opens just below.
  proposer -> block [at: 0]
  now -> 0
